#. ja: 防火の薬
#. de: Feuertrank
#. fr: potion ignifuge
#. column 2: fire ward potions
#. column 8: Everyone knows this elementally charged concoction slightly increases resistance to fire-aspected damage. What few people know, however, is that after long periods of disuse, the liquid undergoes a natural alchemical transformation that grants it the same coloring properties as common dye.<br><br>Cannot be opened in instanced areas such as dungeons, PvP areas, or raids.
#. column 9: Fire Ward Potion
msgctxt "Item:4614:0:0"
msgid "fire ward potion"
msgstr ""

#. de: Feuertränke
#. fr: potions ignifuges
#. column 0: fire ward potion
#. column 8: Everyone knows this elementally charged concoction slightly increases resistance to fire-aspected damage. What few people know, however, is that after long periods of disuse, the liquid undergoes a natural alchemical transformation that grants it the same coloring properties as common dye.<br><br>Cannot be opened in instanced areas such as dungeons, PvP areas, or raids.
#. column 9: Fire Ward Potion
msgctxt "Item:4614:0:2"
msgid "fire ward potions"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 火属性を防ぐ力を持つと信じられていた薬。<br>新たに顔料としての利用価値が見出された。<br>使用するとピグメントに変化<br>[都市やフィールドで使用可能]
#. de: Früher erhöhte der Trank zeitweise die Feuerresistenz, aber diese Wirkung hat er verloren. Nun werden daraus bei Gebrauch Farbpigmente gewonnen. (Kann nicht in instanziierten Inhalten verwendet werden.)
#. fr: Cette préparation était utilisée pour des vertus de prétendue résistance à l'élément feu, mais il a été découvert que son usage procure un excellent pigment.<br>[Utilisable dans les cités et les zones en dehors]
#. column 0: fire ward potion
#. column 2: fire ward potions
#. column 9: Fire Ward Potion
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:4614:0:8"
msgid "Everyone knows this elementally charged concoction slightly increases resistance to fire-aspected damage. What few people know, however, is that after long periods of disuse, the liquid undergoes a natural alchemical transformation that grants it the same coloring properties as common dye.<br><br>Cannot be opened in instanced areas such as dungeons, PvP areas, or raids."
msgstr ""

