msgid "This comprehensive manual on crafting contains knowledge amassed over centuries by well-traveled Disciples of the Hand. It is known to inspire all who read it, granting a temporary 150% boost to experience points earned from synthesis (up to a maximum of 250,000 points). Effect is halved at level 40 and above.<br><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 18 hours"
msgstr ""

