#. ja: 射手魚
#. de: Bogenschützenfisch
#. fr: poisson-archer
#. column 2: archerfish
#. column 8: When feeding, the archerfish will lift its head ever so slightly above a lake's or river's surface and spit a stream of water up to a yalm to strike flies from low-lying branches into the water with remarkable accuracy.<br><br>[Suitable for display in aquariums tier 2 and higher.]<br>[Suitable for printing on medium canvases.]
#. column 9: Archerfish
msgctxt "Item:4999:0:0"
msgid "archerfish"
msgstr ""

